{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Miaotofu01/Dida-TUI/issues/36","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Miaotofu01/Dida-TUI","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Miaotofu01/Dida-TUI/issues/36/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Miaotofu01/Dida-TUI/issues/36/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Miaotofu01/Dida-TUI/issues/36/events","html_url":"https://github.com/Miaotofu01/Dida-TUI/issues/36","id":5708652306,"node_id":"I_kwDOU7m4nM8AAAABVEMfEg","number":36,"title":"自定义视图：建 / 改 / 删","user":{"login":"Miaotofu01","id":196646782,"node_id":"U_kgDOC7iXfg","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/196646782?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Miaotofu01","html_url":"https://github.com/Miaotofu01","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Miaotofu01/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Miaotofu01/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Miaotofu01/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Miaotofu01/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Miaotofu01/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Miaotofu01/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Miaotofu01/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Miaotofu01/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Miaotofu01/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":12540536715,"node_id":"LA_kwDOU7m4nM8AAAAC63lniw","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Miaotofu01/Dida-TUI/labels/ready-for-agent","name":"ready-for-agent","color":"0E8A16","default":false,"description":"Fully specified, ready for an AFK agent","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":0,"created_at":"2026-10-05T08:13:12Z","updated_at":"2026-10-05T08:17:10Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"OWNER","active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":1,"total_blocked_by":1,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"## Parent\n\n#30\n\n## What to build\n\n用户能建自己的视图（「高优先级未完成」这类），并且**改得动、删得掉**。视图 = 一组过滤条件 + 一个名字。过滤维度：清单范围（多选）、截止时间区间（相对逻辑日表达，例如「今天到期」「最近七天」「无日期」）、优先级（多选）、标签（多选）、完成状态。\n\n- 按 `n` **先问一句「清单还是视图」**——这两种东西后面完全是两回事。\n- 选视图后进浮层填名字与条件。**清单的建 / 改表单与视图的条件表单是同一个浮层**，按选中行的类型决定字段（清单那张工单会用到同一个浮层，谁先落地谁把浮层壳子搭出来）。\n- 按 `e` 改当前视图的条件，改完立刻生效。\n- 按 `d` 一次 y/n 确认后删除。**删视图不删除任何任务**——视图只是过滤条件。\n\n视图定义存**本地库**，不存配置文件：那是放 token 的文件，不该为了改一个过滤条件去手写凭据。求值在本地对全量缓存做，不走服务端的查询接口——那个接口的日期区间过滤的是开始时间而不是截止时间，而且硬顶 200 条、没有分页，根本表达不了「今天到期」。\n\n浮层里要**如实说清**：自定义视图只存在这台机器上，手机上、网页版上没有它，换台机器就没了。这是 API 的能力上限，不是实现疏漏——不要试图把视图同步上去，那条路不存在。\n\n## Acceptance criteria\n\n- [ ] 清单列表页按 `n` 先被问「清单还是视图」\n- [ ] 选视图后能在浮层里填名字与过滤条件：清单范围、日期区间、优先级、标签、完成状态\n- [ ] 视图定义落本地库，不写进配置文件\n- [ ] 浮层里明确告知视图只存在本机\n- [ ] 建好的视图出现在清单列表页，`enter` 进去看到过滤后的任务\n- [ ] 按 `e` 能改条件，改完立刻生效（不必重进这一页）\n- [ ] 按 `d` 一次 y/n 确认后删除该视图\n- [ ] 删除视图不删除任何任务\n- [ ] 能建出「高优先级未完成」和一个「最近完成」的例子（后者按完成状态与完成时间筛）\n- [ ] 求值走纯函数那条路径，与内置视图同一份实现\n\n## Blocked by\n\n- #35\n","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Miaotofu01/Dida-TUI/issues/36/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Miaotofu01/Dida-TUI/issues/36/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null}